WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.470
Meet Propel, a Chrome extension that helps with the repetitive parts of job applications.

2
00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:08.814
Add your résumé and choose your submission settings.

3
00:00:08.814 --> 00:00:11.869
Then open a role you want, and select Apply here.

4
00:00:12.769 --> 00:00:17.365
Propel fills supported fields from your saved information, and attaches your résumé.

5
00:00:18.265 --> 00:00:20.667
If a question needs you, it pauses.

6
00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:23.068
Answer in the side panel, then continue.

7
00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:28.699
With automatic submission switched off before you start, Propel stops before submit.

8
00:00:28.699 --> 00:00:31.459
Review the form, and send it yourself.

9
00:00:32.359 --> 00:00:34.508
Your applications stay together in Propel.

10
00:00:34.508 --> 00:00:37.374
Some pages and sign-in checks still need you.

11
00:00:37.374 --> 00:00:38.807
You stay in control.
